---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /regions/
title: Regions
seo:
  title: "Regions — Andean Road"
  description: "Chile by region: Santiago, Casablanca Valley wine country, the Central Coast, the Andes, Pomaire, and the Lake District."
---

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-overline">By geography</div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">Regions</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">Chile is long — 2,600 miles of it. Here's the country broken into the pieces you'd actually plan a trip around.</p>
</div>

<hr class="rule rule--heavy">

<section class="section">
  {% for slug, region in regions %}
    {% set count = 0 %}
    {% for item in collections.places %}
      {% if item.data.region == slug %}{% set count = count + 1 %}{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  <a href="/regions/{{ slug }}/" class="guide-entry">
    <div class="guide-entry__overline">{{ count }} place{{ "s" if count != 1 }}</div>
    <div class="guide-entry__title">{{ region.label }}</div>
    <div class="guide-entry__description">{{ region.description }}</div>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
